<title>UK: Citibank leads $50 mln bond for Citi Investments.</title>
<headline>Citibank leads $50 mln bond for Citi Investments.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITI INVESTMENTS SA</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     8.10	MATURITY    01.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.96    CLOSE DATE  03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    100.96    SPREAD	+173 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y.	HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CITI INVESTMENTS SA IS A SPECIAL PURPOSE VEHICLE</p>
<p>		WHOSE ASSETS CONSISTS OF LOANS PREVIOUSLY ISSUED</p>
<p>		BY CITIBANK NA - BRAZIL BRANCH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
